<div class="cb-bundle-shell" data-product-id="{{ product.id }}" data-cb-template="bob">
  {%- assign cb_v = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
  {%- assign cb_ssr = product.metafields.bob_bundle.booster_ssr -%}
  <div class="cb-bundle-media">
    {%- if product.featured_image -%}
      <img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ product.title | escape }}" width="900" loading="eager" />
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
  <div class="cb-bundle-main">
    <h1 class="cb-bundle-title">{{ product.title | escape }}</h1>
    {%- comment -%}
      Widget mount ABOVE the Add to cart — combo card, or the list/grid widget,
      sit where the price/offer belongs. Full SSR: the combo card is rendered
      server-side at save and stored in the booster_ssr metafield (one shared
      template, per-product content — the landing page's page.content parallel),
      output raw so the client hydrates it: instant paint, crawlable, no flash.
      Empty for older boosters / list-grid → the widget renders fresh into it.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div id="cb-bundle-host">{% if cb_ssr != blank %}{{ cb_ssr.value }}{% endif %}</div>
    <form action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="cb-bundle-form" data-cb-bundle-form>
      <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ cb_v.id }}">
      <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
      <button type="submit" name="add" class="cb-bundle-atc">{{ 'products.product.add_to_cart' | t | default: 'Add to cart' }}</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  .cb-bundle-shell{width:100%;max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;box-sizing:border-box;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:32px;align-items:start}
  .cb-bundle-media img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;display:block}
  .cb-bundle-title{margin:0 0 16px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25}
  .cb-bundle-atc{width:100%;padding:14px 20px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:#111;color:#fff;cursor:pointer}
  @media(max-width:749px){.cb-bundle-shell{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px;padding:16px}}
</style>